msgctxt "wizard.mixedPrompt.quickBody"
msgid "Download only this video, or queue the whole playlist with your active Quick Download profile."
msgstr "Viidiyoo kana qofa buufadhu, yookaan piroofaayila Buufata saffisaa hojiirra jiru fayyadamuun tarree taphachiisaa guutuu gara tarree hojiiitti galchi."

