msgid "Queues every loaded playlist item with the active Quick Download profile. If the scan hits your limit, Arroxy asks before queueing."
msgstr "Wantoota tarree taphachiisaa fe’aman hunda piroofaayila Buufata saffisaa hojiirra jiru fayyadamuun gara tarree hojiiitti galcha. Sakatta’iinsi daangaa kee yoo ga’e, Arroxy tarree hojiiitti galchuu dura ni gaafata."

